        },
        {
          "text": "Iyo kopi y’ikete ry’umwami Aritazeruzi rigisomewe Rehumu na Shimushayi umunyamabanga n’abo bari bafatanije, baca bihuta kuja ku Bayuda bari i Yerusalemu babategeka guhagarika ku nguvu ivyo bariko barakora.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
